            <characteristic name="Options / Upgrades (points not auto-added)" typeId="c70f3d8c-885c-486e-b446-957a93081bda">Base cost is variable (***) - each Tower in the squadron MUST take ONE of: Communications Tower (+40pts, Combat Coordinator [CoA, Die Hard Attitude,12"]); Flak Tower (+40pts, AA becomes 5, gains Heavy Ack-Ack &amp; Sustained Fire [Ack Ack,2]); Generator Tower (+35pts, gains a Main Turret (P) and MUST choose Shield (2) Generator [+35pts] or Disruption (8") Generator [+25pts]). Set this entry's points to match the Tower type(s) taken - the base line item alone has no points value in the source PDF.</characteristic>
